      "id": "nporel:specifiesGrantTerm",
      "type": "owl:ObjectProperty",
      "label": "specifies",
      "comment": "A Grant Agreement specifies one or more Grant Terms. Declared against the abstract Grant Term concept rather than each subtype separately, so any Use Restriction, Grant Condition, Approval Requirement, Reporting Requirement, Compliance Requirement, or Reporting Schedule instance satisfies it the same way.",
